    "criterionNotes": [
      "Criterion 8 assessment: Testing notes: The actual Download test-results table contains every required field. The earlier exploratory measurement-table interpretation is superseded; no missing-column product failure is claimed. In Automobile Download with 30 September local day filters, selected the failed map result 132616647; the test-results table remained open rather than an individual analysis view. Actual labels Start, End and Error correspond to specified Start Time, End Time and Error Message. Rate was N/A on this zero-duration Network Error record; column presence is verified, not a successful rate value.",
      "Criterion 9 assessment: Testing notes: The actual Upload test-results table contains every required field. The earlier exploratory measurement-table interpretation is superseded; no missing-column product failure is claimed. In Automobile Upload with 30 September local day filters, selected the failed map result 132616657; the test-results table remained open rather than an individual analysis view. Actual labels Start, End and Error correspond to specified Start Time, End Time and Error Message. Rate was N/A on this zero-duration Network Error record; column presence is verified, not a successful rate value.",
      "Criterion 10 assessment: Testing notes: The explicit each-value unit requirement is contradicted by chart tooltip values lacking their applicable units; summary/table values and axis labels carry units. This is a bounded observed tooltip failure, not a claim about all other records.",
      "Criterion 11 assessment: Testing notes: Compared the selected cluster's table, including all seven Error cells, with the genuine null-error values. Each displayed No Error.",
      "Criterion 14 assessment: Testing notes: Activated the failed map aggregate near 52.19498/0.13184; genuine POST /api/platform/automobile/download/cluster-details HTTP 200 returned test 132616647 with testDurationMs:0 and identical startTime/endTime 2026-09-30T12:00:07.383.",
      "Criterion 15 assessment: SIMULATED UI STATE: Delayed the selected detail request to check loading. The evidence shows target 132004961 and Loading Automobile test analysis without the baseline chart or sample table.",
      "Criterion 16 assessment: SIMULATED UI STATE: Returned HTTP 503 for the selected detail request to check error handling. Normal target selection received one synthetic HTTP 503 Service Unavailable, text/plain Service Unavailable, using standard HTTP failure semantics rather than an invented project response body/empty-data contract. repair-final.png shows target 132004961's genuine summary and Unable to load Automobile test analysis with Retry; the previous record's chart/sample table is absent from selected analysis."
